# Copy this file to:
#   C:\Users\PatrickdaSilvaLessa.AzureAD\key\da_learn\.env
# (a vault folder OUTSIDE this project, not da_learn/.env - keeps the
# secret out of this repo entirely, same idea as data_base/secrets.toml
# for the rest of analise_representante) and fill in the real values
# there. Never commit real credentials anywhere, including in a copy of
# this file. Only read by anonymize/anonymize_data.py, only when called
# with --upload-supabase - the app (data_app_gestao.py) never reads these,
# it only reads local parquet files under data/.
#
# Use a SEPARATE Supabase project from the one classificacao_medicos_painel
# uses for real representative data - do not point this at that project
# without deciding, first, that mixing fake practice data into it is
# actually what you want.

DA_LEARN_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
DA_LEARN_SUPABASE_KEY=your-service-role-or-anon-key
